Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:02.38,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}My name's Conan Edogawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:05.52,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}High school student Shin'ichi was forced to take a drug that shrunk him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:06.98,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Although smaller, my intelligence remains the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.85,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I solve cases not even adults can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:11.72,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Sorry for the wait!\NToday's Conan is a one-hour special!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:13.49,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Multiple murders on a southern island!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.83,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The sad truth behind a piano sonata!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:04.63,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Why does the famous detective Kogoro Mouri\Nhave to go to a stupid island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:10.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,when he could be spending his time at a flower viewing party?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:14.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's all because of that letter I got a week ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.77,Flashback,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"On the night of the next full moon,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:18.77,Flashback,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"shadows will once again begin to disappear from Tsukikage Island."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:21.64,Flashback,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"Investigate. Keiji Aso."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:25.11,Flashback,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Mouri Detective Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:27.55,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Two days until the next full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:30.82,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I've transferred half a million to your bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:31.82,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}You had best come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:34.69,Flashback,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hold on! Who the heck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:38.56,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Keiji Aso from Tsukikage Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.56,0:02:41.80,Flashback,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hey, wait! Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:45.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He didn't even bother for me to accept him as a client or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What's to complain about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:49.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,At least we get to relax on a small island near Izu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Right, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:54.91,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\pos(457.5,525)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Tsukikage Island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:58.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Keiji Aso...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:00.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone by that name in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:03.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Look harder, could you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:06.05,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I have a letter from him right here, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:09.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But he's not in the list of residents,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and I just moved to this island, so I don't know that much about—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:13.63,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:19.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Chief, it seems that these people have been hired by a resident here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:20.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hired?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's right. By someone named Keiji Aso...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:27.63,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What? Did you say Keiji Aso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:39.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's not possible!\NHe's been dead for over 10 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:50.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He was a famous pianist who was born and raised on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:54.44,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was the night of a full moon, 12 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.50,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was his first time home in a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:04:00.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,so he held a concert in the town's community center.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:03.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But afterwards, he suddenly shut his family and himself inside their home
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:06.55,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and lit the place on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:09.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He allegedly stabbed his wife and daughter to death
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:13.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and then continued to play the piano as the fire raged on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:16.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,almost as if he was possessed by something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:21.69,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Beethoven's piano sonata... "Moonlight".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:28.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,A letter from a dead man...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What a nasty prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:31.94,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's not necessarily the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:37.41,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Your fee was paid, plus the letter was postmarked from this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:43.22,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I bet someone on the island wants you to look into Keiji Aso's affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.69,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:48.76,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The mayor here used to be a good friend of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:50.79,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Maybe he can tell us something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:51.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:55.86,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They said the mayor's over at the community center, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:59.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Now then, Kenta-{\i1}kun{\i0}. Make sure to keep warm when you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:01.07,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Ok, I will! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:03.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:05.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:06.97,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Where is the community center?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:12.08,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You turn that corner and then keep going straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.55,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wait, are you folks from Tokyo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:17.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's right. We got off the ship just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:19.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I live in Tokyo too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:22.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But this island is so much nicer,\Nwouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:26.29,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The air's fresh, and it's nice and quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:30.80,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Protect the island's fishing industry!\NVote for Masato Shimizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:32.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Well, maybe not too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The mayoral election is coming up, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:36.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The mayoral election, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:40.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The candidates are Shimizu-{\i1}san{\i0},\Nwho represents the fishermen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:44.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,current mayor Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0},\Nwhose popularity is dwindling as of late,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:48.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0},\Nthe wealthiest man on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.62,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,My patients have been telling me\Nthat Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} will probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:55.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's alright, Nurse. We're not really\Nthat interested in the election...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:59.67,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\pos(540,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Doctor\NNarumi Asai (26)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:58.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's Doctor Narumi Asai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:59.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I have an actual license, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:04.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,If you folks are headed to the community center,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:07.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,you can meet the three of them there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:10.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Tonight they're holding a 3rd-year memorial for Kameyama-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:12.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,our previous mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Your previous mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:16.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,A 3rd-year memorial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.66,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Don't let the mayor continue his reign of terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Don't let the mayor continue his reign of terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.95,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:28.16,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(570,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Current Mayor of Tsukikage Island\NTatsuji Kuroiwa (56)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,How dare they do this on the night
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,of the previous mayor's memorial?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:31.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They're really getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:32.37,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\pos(480,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Kuroiwa's Only Daughter\NReiko Kuroiwa (27)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:32.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hirata!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:36.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!\NShut them up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.59,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(570,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Secretary to the Mayor\NKazuaki Hirata (31)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:41.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Don't let the mayor continue his reign of terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:43.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hey, everything OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.44,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Is what OK, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They're saying this election
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:49.56,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(570,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Reiko's Fiancé\NShuichi Murasawa (27)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:49.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,ain't looking so good for your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:53.25,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Indeed. It would seem the citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:54.87,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(570,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Wealthiest Man in Town\NHideo Kawashima (56)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:54.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,favor me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:59.29,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's only because you know how to use money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:01.92,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Which I learned from you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.89,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There's a man here who wants to see the mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:06.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Who is it, at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:09.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,A detective from Tokyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What? A detective?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:17.07,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Come on, how long are they\Ngoing to make me wait?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:23.10,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}A piano...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:26.58,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Stop that, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:30.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Huh? What a huge room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:35.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,So the rear of the community center is on the water's edge...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:37.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This piano sure is dirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:40.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You'd think they could at least clean it once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:43.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No, don't touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:50.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's the cursed piano that Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} played the day he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:53.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Cursed? Give me a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:55.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} wasn't the only one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:58.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to the last mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.88,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You mean Isamu Kameyama-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,the person they're holding the memorial for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.72,0:08:06.45,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes. It happened 2 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:10.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was the night of a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:14.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I was passing by the community center,\Nwhich should have been empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:18.30,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,when I heard the sounds of\Na piano coming from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:22.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,When I called out to see who\Nwas there, the music stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:27.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Inside, I found Kameyama-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:29.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He had died of a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.71,0:08:32.65,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And the music he had been playing before he died
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:38.05,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,was the same piece Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} had performed in the fire: "Moonlight".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:44.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,After that, this piano came to\Nbe known as the Cursed Piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:48.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:51.39,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Seems normal enough to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:57.34,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Anyway, please wait by the front\Ndoor until the memorial is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:09:00.41,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, you're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.28,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Narumi-{\i1}san{\i0}! Are you going to the memorial?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:08.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes. Kameyama-{\i1}san{\i0} was the first person I autopsied when I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.82,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I thought I would burn some incense in his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:14.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Shimizu-{\i1}san{\i0}. I happened to meet him on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:16.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hello, my name's Shimizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:18.45,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,400)\pos(570,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Mayoral Candidate\NMasato Shimizu (49)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.45,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.80,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(570,405)\alpha&H1F&\3c&HAF5F3F&}Unemployed\NKen Nishimoto (55)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:26.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hey, Kawashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:31.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You hired a detective to dig up\Nsome dirt on me, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:33.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:35.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Running away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:36.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:43.05,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:46.05,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That piano should have remained unused for years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:48.26,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}but it produced a perfect sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:51.09,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Someone must be tuning it secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:53.23,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}For some purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:58.06,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}And what exactly was that letter trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:09.58,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This song!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.81,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...Moonlight! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:13.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:17.08,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hey! Little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:23.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.08,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:31.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:35.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Ran. Contact the local police station!\N- Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:38.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi. Please inspect the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:40.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:41.98,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Now I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:45.21,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That letter warned that another person on Tsukikage Island
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:48.72,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}would die on the night of a full moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:54.66,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's the curse! It's the curse of the piano!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:59.99,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There's no curse. It's this tape recorder that's playing the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:07.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This was a murder designed to resemble the previous two incidents!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:08.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Murder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:11.27,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hey now, don't be getting ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:14.34,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:18.68,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'm a famous detective from Tokyo—Kogoro Mouri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:21.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, the astronaut?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:24.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No, he's the one in all those mystery novels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's Akechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Then who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.70,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:38.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Approximate time of death was\N30 minutes to an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He probably died of suffocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.37,0:11:43.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,My guess is that Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:45.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Drowned by someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I can't say any more without performing an autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.91,0:11:51.68,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I think Dr. Narumi is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:53.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,See, there's a suit jacket on the beach outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:56.92,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I bet it belongs to Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:12:01.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There's a trail of water here that goes from the door to the piano
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:04.39,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and there's mud and sand on Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}'s back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:08.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And judging from the fact that the door and windows were all locked,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:12.93,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and that the first few minutes of the cassette tape are blank...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:15.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,When did he become so—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:19.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The killer probably took Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} to the ocean during the memorial,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,drowned him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:23.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,dragged the body into this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,locked the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:27.41,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,turned the tape recorder on, and then exited into the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:28.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:31.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, sounds about right to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:37.66,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Assuming the door to this room was locked,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:40.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,there's a high possibility the killer\Nreturned to the memorial afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:43.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,since we were at the front door the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hold on just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:48.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Are you saying the killer's still among us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.09,0:12:59.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, the killer is in this very room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:03.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Did anyone here see Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} leave his seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:08.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I saw him. He said he was going to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:11.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Did anybody see anyone else leave their seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.81,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,As if we could remember every\Nlittle thing that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:19.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,In that case, did anyone have any\Ngrudges with Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:21.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's not exactly a grudge,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:25.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,but the person most happy about\Nhis death would be Shimizu-{\i1}kun{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:28.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,his opponent in the mayoral election!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:32.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?! The same goes for you, Mayor Kuroiwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:34.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, without Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:36.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Daddy's victory would practically be guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.50,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,As long as a certain someone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:42.07,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,wasn't plotting to steal\NKawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}'s votes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:42.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:44.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Now, now, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:45.98,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Calm down now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:50.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But why did the killer put the body in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:55.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Because the killer wanted to place\Nthe blame on the cursed piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:57.92,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Say, just how long has this piano been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:03.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's been here ever since Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} donated it 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:06.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Aso-{\i1}san{\i0}, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:10.19,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes. His name is even on the keyboard lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:17.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's sheet music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:21.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's strange. This wasn't here\Nwhen we checked this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.25,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:31.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:33.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He did rather well for himself back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:37.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I hear he spent lots of money\Non alcohol, women, and gambling...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:40.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But after the mayor died 2 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:44.30,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,he stopped going out, almost as\Nif he were afraid of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:49.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wasn't he a childhood friend of yours, Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.14,0:14:52.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose you could say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:54.68,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Here's a policeman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:55.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're late, Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:15:00.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But I had to look for him;\Nhe wasn't at the police station!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:02.65,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Who called for me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:06.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This gentleman here.\NHis name is Kogoro Mouri-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:07.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, the famous—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:09.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- That's right!\N- Astronaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:11.93,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:14.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,At any rate, it's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:17.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,We can put off collecting information until tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:21.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This was no murder. It was Aso-{\i1}san{\i0}'s curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,How horrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:28.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They should just burn that creepy old piano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:34.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yeah. Maybe we'd be better\Noff without that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:36.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:40.82,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Your deductions sure surprised me, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He loves playing detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:47.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Everyone was talking about how\Namazing his persuasiveness was!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:49.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I was just pretending to be like Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.37,0:15:52.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I always get to see him at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:57.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's just a baby chick compared to me, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.17,0:16:00.11,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Well, we'll head back to the hotel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:04.05,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'll see you later then. Please solve\Nthis case as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:07.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'd rather not have to examine any more bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:11.28,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Don't you worry! This'll be a\Npiece of cake with me at the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:17.13,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Whatever. Not even I really\Nknow what's going on yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.00,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:23.37,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That letter said, "begin to disappear"...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:26.94,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Meaning this isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:30.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What? This murder spree has yet to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:34.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This letter gives warning about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:37.58,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,"Shadows disappearing" means "being enveloped by light".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:41.95,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Light stands for the song played at\Nall the murder scenes—Moonlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:43.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Now I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:47.29,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The song Mr. Aso played in the fire 12 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:51.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And the song the mayor played\Nbefore he died 2 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:54.03,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was Beethoven's piano sonata, Moonlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:58.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And all three incidents have\Ntaken place beside the piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You two go back to the hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.76,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:06.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Ran-{\i1}neechan{\i0}! Let's go to the community center too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:12.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're crazy if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:14.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Spending a night with a corpse like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:16.89,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And with a kid, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:21.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:25.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Tell me, who moved the body without permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:31.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I felt bad for the poor guy,\Nbeing stuck in that position...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.94,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't have,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,we're not through investigating the crime scene yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:38.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Huh? The sheet music's gone.\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:42.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, I took that so it wouldn't get lost. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Stupid old geezer...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:44.82,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:46.68,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This sheet music is for Moonlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:47.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:48.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Moonlight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:58.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What're you doing? You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:02.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No, this fourth bar is weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Fourth bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:06.30,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Maybe this sheet music is actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:08.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}'s dying message...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:11.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,If so, then the killer might come back for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:13.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Pardon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:17.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,When I asked for you at the hotel,\Nthey said you were all here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:18.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:21.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I brought some dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:23.25,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:25.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...we could use some food...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:31.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,So you're not originally from\Nthis island then, Dr. Narumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:35.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No. I return to Tokyo on the weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:37.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's almost like I work as a part-time doctor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:40.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to work\Non a small island like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:44.27,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,surrounded by nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:46.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I've been working here for 2 years now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.11,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.11,0:18:54.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Did Mayor Kameyama really die\Nof a heart attack two years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:58.29,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes. He had always had heart troubles...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:01.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But his face looked rather convulsive,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:04.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,almost as if he saw something horrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:07.50,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Did you notice anything strange at the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:10.50,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hmm, now that you mention it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I think one of the windows was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,A window?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:21.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I believe we chalked that up to\Nsomeone forgetting to close it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Which window was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:24.27,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,If I remember right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:28.99,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...it was this window.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:31.45,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:32.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:33.99,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:41.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Damn it! We lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:46.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I was right! He did come back to get this sheet music!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:49.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,OK! We're going to stay up all night\Nand keep watch over this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Agreed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.01,0:19:51.47,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Agreed!\N- Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:55.11,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hey. Mouri-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:57.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Mouri-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:58.82,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:01.79,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Inspector Megure-{\i1}dono{\i0}...\NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:04.69,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This island's technically part of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:06.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Where did I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:10.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,If you're looking for the sheet music,\NConan-{\i1}kun{\i0} gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:12.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He also gave me the gist of the situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:16.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,All three of them were still\Nawake by the time I arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:20.34,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You and that old man were the only ones asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:22.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They're interrogating people\Nover at the town hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:24.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Come give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:25.94,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:39.49,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,We really shouldn't have slept there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.49,0:20:42.49,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dad! Well? Did you figure out who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:47.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. There were\N38 people at the memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:49.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:52.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Sorry, but when will it be my turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:56.27,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You seem exhausted,\Nso you're scheduled to be last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:21:00.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,In that case, I think I'll go\Nwash my face in the ladies' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:03.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,How many more interviewees are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:06.62,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Including Dr. Narumi, there's six:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:10.82,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The mayor's daughter, Reiko Kuroiwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:13.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,her fiancé, Shuichi Murasawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.29,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,mayoral candidate, Masato Shimizu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.63,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,the mayor's secretary, Kazuaki Hirata,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:21.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and Ken Nishimoto,\Nwho we're interviewing right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:23.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,but he's really wasting our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:25.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He won't say a word, no matter what we ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:28.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,My instincts say he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:31.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Idiot! There's no curse on the piano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:35.08,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,As long as that thing's around,\Nthese murders will keep happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.81,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But, Mayor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:39.32,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dispose of it immediately! You hear me, Hirata?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:40.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.39,0:21:47.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:51.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I have no motive for killing Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:54.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wow, listen to Reiko-{\i1}san{\i0} go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:56.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,She's been shouting for 10 minutes straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:57.87,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.87,0:22:03.01,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}They're through questioning him,\Nso why isn't Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0} leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:05.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:07.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I need to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.95,0:22:19.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Huh? Did Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0} come in here just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:20.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:23.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Crap! He took the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:29.32,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This music...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:33.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's the second movement of Moonlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:36.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Where's it coming from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:38.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The broadcast room!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:40.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:47.11,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:51.25,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No, don't go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:54.99,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Get the examiners and autopsy team here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:55.69,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:59.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The autopsy team left for Tokyo this evening to work on Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:00.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:02.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Damn it! Now, of all times!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:04.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:05.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I can do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:10.94,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But now this narrows down the\Nsuspects to a handful of people!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:13.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,So the killer is still—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:16.61,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,All the exits to this building are guarded by police.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.61,0:23:18.01,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.01,0:23:21.78,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Who is it? Who's the killer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:33.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It appears only a few minutes have passed since the victim's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:38.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, the first 5 minutes and 30 seconds of this tape seem to be blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:39.58,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Inspector Megure!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:41.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There was something strange beneath the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:42.88,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.22,0:23:47.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Sheet music?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:50.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Is this another dying message from the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:56.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,If he had the time and strength\Nto write all this with his own blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.10,0:23:57.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,he would've called for help instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:24:01.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The killer probably left each of these behind to—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:06.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh no! That's important evidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.51,0:24:08.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:11.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're in the way! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.05,0:24:20.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Seeing as Beethoven's Moonlight Sonata\Nwas played after each murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.06,0:24:29.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,it would seem the same person killed\NKawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} and Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.20,0:24:32.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And judging from the amount of blank tape,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.10,0:24:33.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0} must have been killed
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.74,0:24:37.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,around 6:30, only minutes before he was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.54,0:24:40.55,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,In other words, the killer\Nmust have been one of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.55,0:24:43.68,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,since you were the only ones in\Nthe community center at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.68,0:24:45.88,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Excluding Mouri-{\i1}kun{\i0} and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.53,0:24:47.37,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(480,540)\bord0\alpha&H1F&}Ken Nishimoto
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:50.87,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(480,540)\bord0\alpha&H1F&}Narumi Asai
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.21,0:24:54.83,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\pos(480,510)\bord0\alpha&H1F&}Kazuaki Hirata
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:25:00.34,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\pos(240,555)\bord0\alpha&H1F&}Shuichi Murasawa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:25:00.34,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\pos(720,555)\bord0\alpha&H1F&}Reiko Kuroiwa
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.55,0:25:04.26,CharCard,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(480,540)\bord0\alpha&H1F&}Masato Shimizu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:48.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,that leaves us with Ken Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0},\Nwho was the first to find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.09,0:24:51.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi Asai, who was kind enough\Nto inspect the body for us just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.52,0:24:55.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Kazuaki Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0}, secretary\Nto the late Mayor Kuroiwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:58.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Mayor Kuroiwa's daughter, Reiko Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:00.63,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and her fiancé, Shuichi Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:04.50,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And then Masato Shimizu-{\i1}san{\i0},\Ncandidate in the mayoral election.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:08.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hold on! Why am I a suspect?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:12.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You've been questioning me since 6:20!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.18,0:25:15.55,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're right, you couldn't have done it...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.55,0:25:18.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Then you can exclude Dr. Narumi too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.18,0:25:20.99,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,She's been with us since 6:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.99,0:25:23.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Right, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}?\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.12,0:25:27.76,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,So that leaves the four men as the only suspects...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:32.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but I've been on\Nthis floor since 6:00 or so...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.10,0:25:34.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Do you have anyone to substantiate this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:38.00,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You can all vouch for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:41.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I went to the restroom around 6:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.74,0:25:44.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Tell me, Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.21,0:25:48.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You were the first person to find Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.15,0:25:51.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What exactly were you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.15,0:25:54.49,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Kuroiwa said he wanted to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.49,0:25:56.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn't ask to see him so you could kill him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.75,0:25:58.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.06,0:25:59.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was Shimizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.72,0:26:02.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,With Kawashima and my father taken out of the election,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.53,0:26:07.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,he'd automatically wind up in the mayor's seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:09.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Oh? What are you looking at, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}?\N- Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.77,0:26:13.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- The sheet music the killer left at the murder scene.\N- I would never stoop that low!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.74,0:26:18.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,My guess is that it's a coded message from the murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:22.08,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's anything special about these sharps and flats...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.08,0:26:27.32,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Those are the black keys on the keyboard. You know?{"You know" split off}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:29.19,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Keyboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:32.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Arrest this homicidal maniac before he kills anyone else—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.56,0:26:35.66,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Better watch out. You're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.66,0:26:36.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:40.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This code's easy if you know how to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:44.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's based on the notes that correspond with specific piano keys
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:49.47,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,if you arrange the letters of the alphabet across a piano keyboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.47,0:26:54.28,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Using this, the music found where Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} was killed says,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.28,0:27:01.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,"Better watch out. You're next."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.02,0:27:01.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.59,0:27:03.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.59,0:27:06.69,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What does the other sheet music say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.69,0:27:08.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:12.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,"Extinguished is the anger of the hellfire."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.83,0:27:16.27,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The anger of the hellfire?! Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.27,0:27:20.64,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...that pianist who killed himself in a fire 12 years ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.84,0:27:28.08,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's him! Keiji Aso's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.08,0:27:30.45,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.45,0:27:34.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The bones found in the ashes\Nmatched his dental records.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.15,0:27:36.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's most certainly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.52,0:27:39.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Everything was completely scorched—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:43.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,all that was left was some\Nsheet music in a fireproof safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.73,0:27:46.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Sheet music?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.53,0:27:49.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Where? Where is this sheet music?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.13,0:27:51.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,In the community center storeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.37,0:27:54.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But the key to the storeroom's back at the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:56.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Then go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.37,0:27:58.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.18,0:28:00.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wait, officer! I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.48,0:28:02.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!{add a sheesh after this}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.88,0:28:08.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Say, did Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} really set his own house on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.35,0:28:12.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, there were four eyewitnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:14.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Our previous mayor, Kameyama-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.16,0:28:18.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Mayor Kuroiwa, Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}, and Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.53,0:28:20.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Were those four connected in any way?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:24.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They were all classmates, including Aso-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.70,0:28:27.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Then what about that Murasawa guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.51,0:28:32.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He showed up on the island 3 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:36.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He and the mayor's daughter Reiko-{\i1}san{\i0} were engaged not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:38.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The mayor opposed it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.75,0:28:41.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What about Hirata, the mayor's secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.59,0:28:43.89,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's suspicious if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.89,0:28:45.92,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure what the deal was,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:48.16,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,but he was always sneaking around with Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:50.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,at the community center.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.26,0:28:52.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What about Shimizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:56.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He has a strong sense of justice and\Nhe's very popular with the fishermen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.10,0:29:02.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Are you out of questions, Akechi-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.91,0:29:04.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.91,0:29:08.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Huh? That's odd!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.71,0:29:11.88,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I could swear it was around here somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:16.05,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Come on. You've been looking for over an hour now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.05,0:29:20.32,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Here we go! Here's the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.16,0:29:22.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:24.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Ran-{\i1}neechan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.09,0:29:25.30,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You took too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:27.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Everyone grew tired of waiting\Nso they went home!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.77,0:29:30.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,All the suspects left?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:31.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.10,0:29:36.21,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The killer's last message said that\Nthe hellfire's anger was extinguished,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.21,0:29:38.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,so they figured there would be no more murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.84,0:29:40.08,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.08,0:29:42.38,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Only the 1st and 2nd movements of Moonlight have been played
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.38,0:29:45.38,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}at each of the murder scenes so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:48.79,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Moonlight has one movement left!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.79,0:29:51.25,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'm going to check out the community center!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:55.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wait! Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.93,0:30:00.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Talk about curious, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.33,0:30:01.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.83,0:30:03.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Just hold on, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:09.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Did you just hear a strange sound\Ncome from the piano room?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.01,0:30:11.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.38,0:30:12.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:17.81,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.19,0:30:24.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,M-Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.02,0:30:25.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.26,0:30:26.69,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The storeroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.69,0:30:32.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.13,0:30:34.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Officer! Go call Inspector Megure!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.83,0:30:36.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.60,0:30:41.97,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Was the 3rd movement played?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.97,0:30:43.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There's 30 minutes per side on this tape,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.91,0:30:47.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,which means Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}\Ndied within the last 30 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.78,0:30:48.88,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Look, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.88,0:30:51.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There's some more sheet music\Nat Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}'s feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.59,0:30:58.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What does it say this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:30:59.72,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,"Will".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.72,0:31:01.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's his will?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:03.89,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Then does that mean—
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.89,0:31:05.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,—it was a suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:07.23,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,According to the will,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.23,0:31:10.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,he regretted killing\NMr. Kawashima and Mr. Kuroiwa...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.73,0:31:12.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Nishimoto killed the two of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.37,0:31:17.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He apparently didn't want an old mistake they made to be made known.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:21.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,"They" refers to Mr. Kameyama, who died 2 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.01,0:31:24.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Mr. Kawashima and Mr. Kuroiwa, who were just killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.01,0:31:26.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Mr. Nishimoto, who hanged himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.02,0:31:29.19,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and Mr. Aso, who killed himself 12 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.19,0:31:31.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The pianist too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.36,0:31:35.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,My guess is that they did something, using this code.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.26,0:31:39.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I see. Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0} was afraid their old secret would get out
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.73,0:31:42.93,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,so he broke into the storeroom to destroy the sheet music.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.93,0:31:45.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But unable to find the music and driven into a psychological corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.77,0:31:47.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,he committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.71,0:31:50.71,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I don't think it was a suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.71,0:31:54.11,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's impossible to hang yourself without something to support you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.11,0:31:56.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn't put it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.51,0:31:58.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.42,0:32:03.92,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And I doubt there's anyone who would\Ngo and write their own will in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.92,0:32:07.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Are you saying the murderer is somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.46,0:32:10.19,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- I saw some suspicious people.\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.19,0:32:11.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Two people in the piano room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.96,0:32:14.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,One broke a window and escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:16.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The other was that Murasawa guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.20,0:32:17.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Someone beat him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.57,0:32:21.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi's treating him in\Nthe piano room right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.21,0:32:24.41,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.41,0:32:25.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say that sooner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.74,0:32:28.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.01,0:32:31.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You still haven't found Mr. Aso's sheet music?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.78,0:32:36.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was 12 years ago; there's no way for me to remember where we put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.69,0:32:40.66,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Is he still unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.66,0:32:44.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes. I think he may have suffered a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.09,0:32:45.66,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Say, Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.66,0:32:49.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What was Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0} doing here this late anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.77,0:32:51.93,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,How should I know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.44,0:32:55.87,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}This is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.87,0:32:58.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off Shuichi's stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.04,0:32:59.41,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.41,0:33:03.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Don't ask me! But it was important to Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.38,0:33:07.45,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That's a tuning hammer, used to tune pianos.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.45,0:33:09.55,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}So he was the one who—
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.55,0:33:13.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,OK! Bring all the suspects\Nto the town hall at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.96,0:33:14.89,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:22.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.53,0:33:23.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Let's go to the town hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.80,0:33:26.47,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The suspicious person who ran out of this room
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.47,0:33:30.01,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,was looking for something under the piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.01,0:33:32.00,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.08,0:33:36.88,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Wow, a hidden panel! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.58,0:33:42.35,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Drugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.12,0:33:46.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,{\a6}"Tsukikage Island Town Hall"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.16,0:33:49.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Judging from the methods\Nemployed in all three murders,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.53,0:33:52.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,they are all clearly the work of the same person!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.53,0:33:56.30,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi and Reiko Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}\Nhave confirmed alibis
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.30,0:33:58.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and are no longer suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.20,0:34:01.04,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But there are no alibis for\Nthe secretary Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.04,0:34:03.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,the mayoral candidate Shimizu-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.51,0:34:07.28,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,nor for Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0},\Nwho is currently resting at the clinic...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.28,0:34:10.45,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The killer is one of these three!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.45,0:34:12.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi. Is Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0} still unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:16.79,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Yes. Reiko-{\i1}san{\i0} is looking after him,\Nbut he has yet to regain consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.79,0:34:21.33,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}There's something nagging at me, but what could it be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.33,0:34:27.53,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Ever since I saw the code of blood\Nleft at the scene of the crime...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.53,0:34:28.27,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.27,0:34:31.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The photos taken from where\NMr. Kuroiwa was murdered are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.20,0:34:34.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Good. Place them on that desk.\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.48,0:34:43.15,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}What's that light by Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}'s neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.15,0:34:46.42,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}It's off in the picture where he's been moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.42,0:34:51.92,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Um, may I buy some juice? I'm thirsty...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:54.19,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I suppose that'd be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.19,0:34:55.75,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}He's injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.93,0:35:01.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Say, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.73,0:35:04.13,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,There's some white powder on your sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:06.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.17,0:35:10.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Money from all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.17,0:35:13.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'm fond of foreign countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.19,0:35:23.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.09,0:35:27.52,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I finally found the sheet music\NAso-{\i1}san{\i0} left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.52,0:35:29.22,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Let me see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.86,0:35:35.87,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"To my son, Seiji."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.87,0:35:37.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Son?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.10,0:35:43.47,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, come to think of it, Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} had a son too...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.47,0:35:47.51,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He fell seriously ill when he was little\Nand had to be hospitalized...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:51.18,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I believe Seiji was his name...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.18,0:35:52.62,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Seiji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.62,0:35:54.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.42,0:36:03.79,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Where do you think you're going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.27,0:36:12.50,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Ah, now I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.50,0:36:14.64,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The reason the killer dragged Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} into the piano room
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.64,0:36:17.04,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}after drowning him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.04,0:36:19.41,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The meaning of the music played at the murder scenes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.41,0:36:23.41,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}And the mystery behind the code written in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.41,0:36:27.75,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}There's no doubt about it!\NThat's the one who did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.38,0:36:35.02,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Old man Mouri received a letter from a dead man
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.02,0:36:37.15,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}and then headed to Tsukikage Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.15,0:36:40.82,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The letter's author was Keiji Aso, a pianist who murdered his family,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.82,0:36:45.76,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}lit his house on fire, and died while playing the Moonlight piano sonata.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.76,0:36:48.53,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The first murder happened on the night of the memorial for Mr. Kameyama,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:50.50,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}the previous mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.50,0:36:52.77,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hideo Kawashima was found dead in the piano room,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.77,0:36:56.01,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}while the first movement of Moonlight played.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.01,0:37:00.01,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The second murder took place\Nas the second movement played.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.01,0:37:02.65,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The victim was the current\Nmayor, Tatsuji Kuroiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.65,0:37:04.88,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The number of suspects was\Nnarrowed down to six people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:08.09,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The third murder was that of Ken Nishimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.09,0:37:10.38,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}He was killed in a manner\Nthat made it look like suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.92,0:37:16.99,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"To my son, Seiji."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.99,0:37:19.46,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Ah, now I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.46,0:37:21.60,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The reason the killer dragged Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0} into the piano room
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.60,0:37:24.13,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}after drowning him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.13,0:37:26.70,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The meaning of the music played at the murder scenes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.70,0:37:30.67,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}And the mystery behind the code written in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.67,0:37:34.54,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}There's no doubt about it!\NThat's the one who did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.88,0:37:41.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, rushing here\Nto the broadcast room like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:43.15,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Is there something here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.15,0:37:45.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.26,0:37:49.49,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I've got no choice! I'll have to\Nuse the old man's voice for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.49,0:37:52.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,One shot of this Tranquilizer Watch Gun and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:57.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0} and Shimizu-{\i1}san{\i0} will have to come to the mainland with us
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.90,0:37:59.10,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.10,0:38:00.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.70,0:38:03.67,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The first incident, in which Mr. Kawashima was drowned
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.67,0:38:07.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and dragged into the community center's piano room last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.38,0:38:09.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The second incident, in which Mr. Kuroiwa was murdered
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.85,0:38:12.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,in the broadcast room this very night...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:15.79,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The third incident, which also took place this very night,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.79,0:38:17.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,in which Mr. Nishimoto was killed in the storeroom
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.59,0:38:20.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,in such a way to make it look like a suicide...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.12,0:38:23.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The only ones without alibis for these three incidents are you two
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:27.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0}, who is resting at the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.70,0:38:30.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to do this, but we'll\Nhave to watch you tonight—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.80,0:38:33.84,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I've figured it out, Inspector!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:36.91,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Almost everything about the\Nmurders on this island, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.91,0:38:39.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dad! You're in the broadcast room?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.14,0:38:43.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,First, the person who beat Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0} unconscious in the piano room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.48,0:38:47.32,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That would be you, Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0}!{at "Hirata-san", switch to radio style}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.32,0:38:48.42,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:50.75,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0} suffered the injury on his left hand
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.75,0:38:53.62,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}when he broke the window and escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.62,0:38:56.66,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}You were also the suspicious\Nperson we saw last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.66,0:38:58.76,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But what was he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.76,0:39:03.20,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He was making deals with\NMr. Kawashima in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.20,0:39:04.37,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Drug deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.37,0:39:06.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Drugs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.24,0:39:08.91,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0} used a hidden panel in the piano
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.91,0:39:14.21,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}to trade drugs he bought overseas for large sums of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.21,0:39:20.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Aha! So that's why they were at the\Ncommunity center every single night!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.35,0:39:24.45,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The reason Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0} always\Nclaimed the piano was cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.45,0:39:27.46,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}was to keep people from getting in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.46,0:39:29.49,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He probably assaulted Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0} and escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.49,0:39:33.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,because Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0} saw him\Ntaking back the drugs he had left there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.83,0:39:34.87,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Does that mean you killed Mr. Kawashima
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:38.07,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,because you were having a dispute with him about the deals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:39.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.40,0:39:43.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hirata-{\i1}san{\i0} has nothing to do\Nwith the three murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.14,0:39:47.18,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}If he was the murderer, he wouldn't have killed anyone in the piano room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.18,0:39:51.65,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That was the room where\Nhe left the drugs, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.65,0:39:53.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Next is Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.75,0:39:55.52,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}He's the killer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:39:59.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's not the killer either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.02,0:40:02.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The reason the killer wrote\Na will to make it look a suicide
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.43,0:40:04.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,but didn't place an object to stand on in the room
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.36,0:40:06.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,was because the murderer bolted\Nwhen Ran and the others showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.83,0:40:09.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It would have been impossible to\Nenter the piano room afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.70,0:40:11.77,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.77,0:40:14.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,So far, our image of the killer\Nhas been that of a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.24,0:40:17.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,because all three murders required someone with strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.54,0:40:20.68,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And someone without an alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.68,0:40:23.78,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The only suspect left is Shimizu-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.78,0:40:27.12,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Next, we need to look at the second murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:31.49,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,We assumed Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0} was killed\Nonly minutes before he was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.49,0:40:33.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But if you'll remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.56,0:40:40.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...the blood code didn't come off\Nwhen Conan fell on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.56,0:40:45.74,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,At room temperature, it takes 15 to\N30 minutes for human blood to dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.74,0:40:49.17,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But that blood was dry,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.17,0:40:52.21,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}even though he was supposedly killed only minutes before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:59.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's right. It was a trick the killer did\Nto alter the estimated time of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.02,0:41:00.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.75,0:41:05.09,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But only the first 5 and a half minutes of the tape were blank!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.09,0:41:06.62,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Automatic tape reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.62,0:41:09.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The killer played the 2nd side of the tape—\Nwhich had no music on it—
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.83,0:41:13.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and gained 30 extra minutes by using tape reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.80,0:41:15.97,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Please have a look at the photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.97,0:41:19.14,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}There's a button lit near Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}'s neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.14,0:41:22.44,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}And the light is off just after his body is moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.44,0:41:27.44,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That's proof that the killer turned\Nit off when you weren't looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.44,0:41:30.81,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But if I remember correctly, the one who approached the body was—
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.81,0:41:32.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.12,0:41:34.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The person who got near the body,\Naside from the police...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.48,0:41:36.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,The person who faked the estimated time of death...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.85,0:41:42.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,...was the one who inspected the body: you, Dr. Narumi!{"you, Dr. Narumi" in radio style}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.36,0:41:47.06,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,That's not true, is it, Dr. Narumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.36,0:41:52.94,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You drowned Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}\Nand dragged him into the piano room
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.94,0:41:55.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,in order to send the coroners back to the mainland,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.14,0:41:58.61,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,since they wouldn't be able to\Nexamine an unnatural death here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.61,0:42:02.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,And the reason you put blank space\Nat the start of each tape
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:06.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,was so that you could throw us off\Nby faking the time of the 2nd murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.75,0:42:10.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Doing this, you altered Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0}'s time of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.85,0:42:13.36,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,thereby creating an alibi for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:17.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But Mouri-{\i1}kun{\i0}! You just said the killer was a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.73,0:42:20.63,Radio,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The motive for the murders extends 12 years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.63,0:42:22.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.53,0:42:26.70,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Back to the incident in which pianist\NKeiji Aso and his family were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.70,0:42:28.57,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Killed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.57,0:42:31.41,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Kawashima-{\i1}san{\i0}, Nishimoto-{\i1}san{\i0}, Kuroiwa-{\i1}san{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.41,0:42:34.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,and the previous mayor, Kameyama-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.38,0:42:36.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They used Aso-{\i1}san{\i0}'s international performances
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.38,0:42:39.75,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,as opportunities to buy and sell drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.75,0:42:44.22,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But then Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} said he refused to help them any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.22,0:42:46.86,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Afraid their secret would get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:51.05,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,they shut him and his family inside his house and set it on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.90,0:42:57.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This is all written in the sheet music that survived that fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:43:01.84,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,In the confession letter that Aso-{\i1}san{\i0} wrote for his child...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.84,0:43:03.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,A son?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.14,0:43:07.58,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He had a son in a Tokyo hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.58,0:43:09.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,One named Seiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.48,0:43:12.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Seiji? It couldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.48,0:43:15.65,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dr. Narumi's real name is Seiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.08,0:43:19.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}Narumi Asai
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.87,0:43:19.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,0)}Seiji Aso
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.65,0:43:19.12,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,She was Keiji Aso's son, Seiji Aso!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.12,0:43:21.83,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.83,0:43:26.63,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Asai is probably his foster family's last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.63,0:43:31.07,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,So it was all to avenge his father...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.07,0:43:33.60,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- Inspector! The killer's gone!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.60,0:43:36.07,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.07,0:43:37.17,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I know where he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.17,0:43:40.97,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}The place where Aso Keiji's donated piano is kept: the community center!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.69,0:43:52.05,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's over, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:55.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:58.03,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Here, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.03,0:44:01.46,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's written in this sheet music your dad left for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.46,0:44:05.54,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He says he wants you to live an honest life!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.54,0:44:08.61,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I wish I had known that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.61,0:44:13.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,How did you find out about your father if you haven't read this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.48,0:44:17.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I always had my suspicions about my foster father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.38,0:44:18.85,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,After graduating from medical school,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.85,0:44:22.89,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I came to this island as a woman doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.89,0:44:28.43,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It doesn't say on my license how\Nto pronounce my name, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.43,0:44:31.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,But I was sweating bullets when\Nthey started questioning people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.73,0:44:33.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,They would've found out I was really a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.80,0:44:37.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I see. So that's why you stayed with us that night—
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.90,0:44:41.40,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,so you could have them question you last.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.40,0:44:46.31,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,When I told Kameyama, the previous mayor, that I was Aso's son,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.31,0:44:49.45,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,he suddenly grew fearful and told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.45,0:44:53.22,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He finished it all off by falling lifeless from a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.22,0:44:58.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It was when I played my father's favorite piece, Moonlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.35,0:45:01.38,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,as a farewell song for him that I came\Nup with the idea for these murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.46,0:45:05.76,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Seiji! Let's get out of here! We can still make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.76,0:45:08.90,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,It's too late for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.90,0:45:14.56,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,These hands are as bloodstained as theirs are.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.01,0:45:20.14,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Conan-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.14,0:45:20.91,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.91,0:45:24.48,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,- No!\N- Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:27.58,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.58,0:45:29.82,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,This is the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.82,0:45:34.59,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,He's playing it. Inside the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.07,0:45:47.97,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Murasawa-{\i1}san{\i0} missed Keiji Aso, the pianist,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.97,0:45:51.24,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,so he apparently tuned his piano on occasion...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.24,0:45:53.80,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,On the night he was assaulted, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.15,0:45:59.35,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Why did Dr. Narumi warn us about the murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.35,0:46:03.02,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,My only guess is that it was actually a letter of challenge to Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.02,0:46:06.79,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,I think she wanted to be stopped from killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.79,0:46:11.33,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Say, what did the code that Dr. Narumi played say?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.33,0:46:13.26,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Oh, I already forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.26,0:46:16.96,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Your expression says otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.72,0:46:28.73,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\a6}"Thank you, {\alpha&HFF&\t(2090,2090,\alpha&H00&)}Little {\alpha&HFF&\t(5040,5040,\alpha&H00&)}Detective"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.06,0:48:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx105\fs42\fsp1.5\shad0\bord0\alpha&H1F&\pos(244,225)}NEXT EPISODE
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.53,0:48:04.73,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Don't tell me the car Ayumi-{\i1}chan{\i0} got in
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.73,0:48:07.22,Thoughts,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur3}belonged to those kidnappers who're killing little girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.67,0:48:11.53,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,Hold on, Ayumi-{\i1}chan{\i0}! We're coming to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.53,0:48:14.98,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,{\a6}Next Conan:
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.53,0:48:14.98,Default,Comment,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,285)\bord0\shad0\b0\fsp0\fnDINk\fs54\c&HFFFFFF&}The Case of Ayumi-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s Abduction
