Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:52.24,RMLyrics,,0,0,0,,kodomo no koro ni wakarikaketeta-koto ga
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:58.67,RMLyrics,,0,0,0,,otona ni natte wakaranai mama
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:04.63,RMLyrics,,0,0,0,,eraku mo nai shi  rippa de mo nai
