Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.18,0:01:16.90,RMLyrics,,0,0,0,,kotae de mo nai hontou de mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:23.02,RMLyrics,,0,0,0,,shinjiteru no wa mune no doki-doki
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:28.53,RMLyrics,,0,0,0,,mune no doki-doki dake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:21.29,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,The first end of the century in 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:27.47,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,When told to cry, I laughed instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:39.52,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,The first end of the century in a long, long time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:45.65,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,We're leaping into a wide open world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:52.24,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,The things I tried to understand as a child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:58.67,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,remain a mystery even as an adult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:04.63,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,I'm neither a hotshot nor especially great
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:11.05,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,All I understand is the pounding of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.18,0:01:16.90,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,It's neither an answer nor the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:23.02,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,All I have faith in is the pounding of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:28.53,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,That, and nothing else
