Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.33,0:46:45.75,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Just my imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.85,0:46:55.47,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx70}samekaketa koucha nominagara  yubi ni karamu ito o asobase
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.18,0:47:04.56,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,bossa nova no rhythm de keikai ni arukou
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.57,0:47:09.45,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,puzzle no piece wa te no naka sa
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.74,0:47:15.86,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,sou sa  Ah-Ah-Ah-
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.95,0:47:25.63,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80}raishuu mo ore wa chigau fuku de onaji basho ni iru sa
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.96,0:47:33.05,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Step by Step  aseru-koto nante nai no sa
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:39.51,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Case by Case  warawareta-tte kamawanai
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.89,0:47:49.27,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80}kazoekirenu hibi no mukou ni  aitsu ga matte-iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.65,0:47:53.78,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,I gotta go my own way
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.85,0:46:55.47,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80}Playing with threads around my finger while drinking lukewarm tea
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.18,0:47:04.56,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Let's walk lightly to the bossa nova rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.57,0:47:09.45,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,The puzzle pieces are in my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.74,0:47:15.86,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.95,0:47:25.63,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the same place next week but with different clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.96,0:47:33.05,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Step by step, there's no reason to be anxious
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:39.51,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Case by case, I don't care if you laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.89,0:47:49.27,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Beyond the countless days, she's waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.56,0:48:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Conan's Hint: School Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.98,0:48:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,642)\fnSegoe\fscx110\bord0\shad0\fs36}Look forward to the next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.85,0:48:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6}Next time is a somewhat strange pattern...
